---
description: Fault injection tests, resilience proofs, outbox idempotency
globs: **/*_fault_test.go, **/fault_*.go, scripts/test/**
alwaysApply: false
---

Apply when adding failure modes, outbox handlers, or resilience tests.

Fault tests live in `*_fault_test.go` / `fault_*` packages. Prove idempotency under duplicate webhooks, Redis outages, PG txn failures, and outbox replays.

Outbox: handler error -> row stays pending and retries; permanent failure -> mark failed + ops alert. Duplicate event IDs must not double-apply side effects.

Alerts (examples): `ad_management_outbox_oldest_pending_seconds` > 30 s; processor lag; Redis circuit open sustained.

Load-test abort rules tie to `core.mdc` (p99 > 80 ms for 30 s).

New hot-path write paths need a fault proof case or explicit waiver in PR.

HTMX/UI faults: out of scope — JSON API only.

Related: `hot-path.mdc`, `control-plane.mdc`, `scripts/test/run_resilience.sh`.
